    "created_at": "2018-02-28T08:01:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-28T08:01:28Z",
    "body": "No, the UI Events specification doesn't really define these events or when they get dispatched. HTML defines that at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#fire-a-focus-event. I filed https://github.com/w3c/uievents/issues/185 to simply stop defining these in UI Events to make this less confusing.",
